35_n544_CampusParis_SENTIENT.mp3","mtime":"1446378023","size":"319528","md5":"a752da4459abe029abbccab5935b2385","crc32":"5f83e33c","sha1":"57d1046ef17ffa113a224239b8f34a98389cfaca"},{"name":"__ia_thumb.jpg","source":"original","mtime":"1711727351","size":"5067","md5":"652b53ee874d73800e5232f03a3933cd","crc32":"d48ea636","sha1":"eeab609f9c858dfb2252415f33fb19ec90a3ff72","format":"Item Tile"}],"files_count":16,"item_last_updated":1711727351,"item_size":88305064,"metadata":{"identifier":"RadiaS35N544CampusParisSENTIENT","mediatype":"audio","collection":["radiafm","radioprograms","radiostationarchives"],"description":"<p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;line-height:19.32px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\">This is a composite piece from various past and current works by OttoannA  which mixes field recordings with ​acousmatic composition​, multilayered collages, fragmented narration,electronic and electroacoustic synthesis… . A sonic trip through ethereal mindscapes that intertwines the tale of Marko Stepanov, an artist and outsider, whose life was transformed by a​ lightning strike whilst on a solitary mountain hike.</p><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0.66em 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;line-height:19.32px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><a href=\"http://www.ottoanna.com/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent;\" rel=\"nofollow\">​OttoannA</a><br />Formed in Paris in 2004, OttoannA (<a href=\"http://www.rodolphe-alexis.info/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent;\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rodolphe Alexis</a> and <a href=\"http://oceanvivasilver.com/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent;\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valérie Vivancos</a>) have been producing sound pieces, devices, publications and participative actions. Their passion for processes has taken various shapes including a software that singles out fragments from TV news and rearranges them into a poetic litany, memories of familiar routes recorded on the edge of hypnosis, one-to-one DJ sets, transposing sounds from the streets of Paris to those of New York via boomboxes, a barely audible live set performed from inside a closet, and audio voyages by boat and in planetariums.</div><div style=\"border:0px;margin:0.66em 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;line-height:19.32px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent;\"> <a href=\"http://www.radia.fm/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/OttannA-Presences-Electronique-2014.jpeg\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent;\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3793\" src=\"//web.archive.org/web/2im_/http://www.radia.fm/wp-content/uploads/2015/08/OttannA-Presences-Electronique-2014.jpeg\" alt=\"OttannA Presences Electronique 2014\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" style=\"border:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;height:auto;background:transparent;\" /></a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent;\">(Photo by Solenn Le bruchec )</div></div>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Campus Paris","title":"Show 0544: Sentient by OttoannA (Campus Paris)","publicdate":"2015-11-01 11:37:46","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2015-11-01 11:37:46","creator":"Campus Paris","date":"2015-08-31","year":"2015","radiaseason":"35","backup_location":"ia905504_17"},"server":"ia800502.us.archive.org","uniq":536359344,"workable_servers":["ia800502.us.archive.org","ia600502.us.archive.org"]}